            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is a 2 or 3 inch mattress topper better?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                A 3 inch topper suits most people, especially side sleepers who want pressure relief. A 2 inch topper is better if you like your mattress and want only a small change, if you sleep on your back or stomach, or if you are choosing a firm latex topper for added support. Four inches is for a dramatic softening.
